 ini←∆CreateIni(name lines);folder;filename
⍝ Writes `lines` into the INI file `<test folder>/<name>/test.ini` and returns an `IniFiles` instance on it.
⍝ The folder is removed first, so every test case starts from scratch.
 folder←∆GetTestFolder,'/',name
 {}##.FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce folder
 'CREATE!'##.FilesAndDirs.CheckPath folder
 filename←folder,'/test.ini'
 (⊂lines)⎕NPUT filename 1
 ini←⎕NEW ##.IniFiles(,⊂filename)
⍝Done
